 "note": "Identified by the printed title 'LUNENBURG PRIMARY SCHOOL / FACULTY / STAFF ROSTER' (lines 1-2), Principal Cyndy Daukantas; preschool-grade 2. Two-column roster; lines 4, 6, 8, 15, 25, 27 hold a section heading in one column beside a person in the other and are entry lines. Line 14 'Teaching Assist. Laurie Xarras' is a single pair between the Preschool and Special Education columns; the line does not say which, so grade_or_dept is empty. Karen Rash appears twice as printed (line 9 Special Education kindergarten 1/2 time; line 44 Reading Teacher 1/2 time) -- two entries, one person, kept as printed. Line 24 '(all district-wide)' is printed beside Jane Dusek under the Speech/OT/Psych group. Line 27 heading reads 'SPECIAL AREA TEACHERS (shared with TC Passios)'. Line 47 page number ignored."
